    // ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
    //  DEFAULT CHART SHAPE (reworked 2026-08-28)
    //  Every type now defaults to a RESPONSIVE 100% width with a height
    //  derived from that width, instead of a fixed pixel box.
    //
    //  Why: a chart authored at a fixed 800px is a small island on a wide
    //  report and overflows a narrow one, and the old 180px height made
    //  almost everything a squat sliver. The % path needs no new machinery -
    //  penumbraResolveVizDim() already resolves it against the snippet
