        // cells whose RENDERED content differs from the raw value (@@HTML,
        // @@JSON, resolver links, entity transforms) - plain cells no longer
        // duplicate the dataset into DOM attributes. So a plain cell that a
        // rewrite() rule mutated is restored from masterRowData instead: row
        // index from the '#' cell (flat) / data-row-index (grouped clones),
        // column name from the header position. Cells with no masterRowData
