    // them can be missing a key again: the pivot-generate gate used to list only
    // the pivot_* keys, so a snippet branching on data(group) - e.g.
    // case(data(group) = true, action(…pivot…), action(…group_by…)) - kept
    // rendering its pre-pivot branch after the pivot built. The view had actually
    // changed on the first click; only the link's LABEL was stale, which reads as
    // "I have to click it twice" and left the toggle one-way (no way back to the
