    // with the value's own aggregation, so the boxes show what the Grand Total
    // column shows today and the author removes or adds from there. Those
    // untouched defaults are PRISTINE and serialize as no override at all
    // (getRowTotalTokens -> null), so ticking the box alone changes nothing. Once
    // touched, the column is exactly the tokens in the boxes: a box emptied with
    // its x has no Grand Total cell, and with every box empty there is no Grand
