    // ---- Reader: plain report ------------------------------------------
    // Picks the most chart-shaped pair it can find rather than the first two
    // columns: a text column with a sane number of distinct values for the X
    // axis, and money (preferred) or a plain number for the Y axis. When the
    // table has no such pair it still produces the most useful chart it can:
    // a single row becomes a gauge, a date-only table a line per period, and
