 * a real New+Removed pair into a false Unchanged/Modified row. Combining two
 * independent 32-bit hashes plus the exact JSON length makes an accidental
 * collision practically impossible while keeping keys tiny (unlike using
 * the raw JSON string, which would hold megabytes in Map keys on wide data).
