    // scoped to manage_snapshots.php only; every other endpoint family relied on
    // its own inline guard, and the ones without a guard failed silently (that is
    // how an expired session on a prompt type-ahead became "no matches").
    // handleSessionExpiredError dedupes, so inline + net overlap = one dialog.
    //
    // The hard part is telling expiry from an authorization denial, since both
    // answer 403. That is what penumbraDenyUnauthenticated()'s header settles:
