     *   - Use Common Columns & Compare → uncheck the "All columns" toggle,
     *                                    populate the key-columns picker
     *                                    with all common columns checked,
     *                                    then invoke doCompareFn(common).
     *   - Compare Anyway              → invoke doCompareFn(null), letting
     *                                    runComparisonAndDisplayGrouped's
     *                                    internal intersection-fallback do
     *                                    the right thing silently.
     *   - Cancel                      → bail; the comparison doesn't run.
