    // --- Saved Presets Management (LOCAL only) ---
    //
    // This tab is about presets stored in THIS browser. Shared (server) presets
    // live in PENUMBRA_PRESETS and are deliberately unreachable from here: every
    // string in the tab says which store it means, because a "Delete all" that
