    // appears in the events list. _schedTestOnceIntent carries the click intent
    // across the save round-trip (mirror of _schedRunAfterSave, kept separate on
    // purpose); _schedTransientTestId / _schedTransientPoll track the queued
    // transient row so it can be canceled or noticed finishing. The form stays
    // in new mode throughout: #schedTaskId is deliberately NEVER set to the
    // transient id (that would turn the form into edit mode on a row that is
